      "text": "Stormeye: Regenerates 15 Energy for Venti after the effects of Wind's Grand Ode end.\nIf an Elemental Absorption occurred, this also restores 15 Energy to all characters of that corresponding element in the party."
    },
    {
      "id": "venti.passive3",
      "unlock": "p3",
      "effects": [],
      "text": "Windrider: Decreases gliding Stamina consumption for your own party members by 20%.\nNot stackable with Passive Talents that provide the exact same effects."
    }
